            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 510/200-US15 Satin Nickel Rectangular Flush Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nLarge contemporary rectangular Satin Nickel flush pull for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, by pass doors doors, or any door where a \"Flush with the door face\" pull is desired. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nConcealed mounting holes add to the clean contemporary styling. Packaged with (2) mounting  screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions FII-510/200-US15 Contemporary Rectangular Flush Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 7-15/16\" (200 MM)</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/4\" (57 MM)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1/8\" Thick Non-Rusting Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Nickel</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/flush-pulls\">Flush Pulls</a></b>\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n</p>",
